{"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"post":{"id":"p_seed_022","createdAt":"2026-09-13T00:01:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-16T03:11:59.168Z","author":{"uid":"u_life","name":"城市生活志","handle":"city_life","verified":true,"bio":"记录城市里的烟火气与人情味","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"进补不等于大补。秋天最容易犯的错，是把「贴秋膘」当成吃顿好的的理由。均衡、适量、规律，才是过冬最稳的方案。#饮食#","images":[],"quote":{"id":"n_041wcrd","title":"秋冬饮食指南：进补不等于大补，均衡才是关键","summary":"天气转凉，进补话题升温。营养师提醒，进补的核心是补充优质蛋白、膳食纤维与维生素，而不是一味摄入高脂高热量食物。","cover":"./img/news/05-health-cover.jpg","channel":"health","channelName":"健康","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":["饮食"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":320,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"views":11226,"bookmarks":31}},"replies":[{"id":"c_seed_p_seed_022_0","createdAt":"2026-09-13T00:12:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-14T09:01:36.680Z","articleId":"p_seed_022","uid":"u_health","user":"健康自习室","handle":"health_study","content":"总结得比我原文还精炼。","likes":74,"status":"published"}],"interactions":{}}}